// prompt: the memory k words (8 * k bytes) after p: the ONE caller of rt_ptr_add (F5e badAlign), so every derived pointer is its
// 8-aligned base plus whole words (fil-c FC58-61 alignment by construction: mmap pages, malloc blocks and arena chunks are 8-aligned).
def Srs.Arena.wordAdd(p: Srs.Mem, k: I64): Srs.Mem = rt_ptr_add(p, 8 * k)

